<title>AUSTRIA: Iraq's Hiti says OPEC did not discuss Iraq's return.</title>
<headline>Iraq's Hiti says OPEC did not discuss Iraq's return.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The head of Iraq's OPEC delegation Osama al-Hiti said the group had no specific discussions of his country's planned resumption of exports at OPEC's session on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He added that talks he had held with individual ministers on the matter had been &quot;positive, very positive.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
